T*
(- Node.js 18+ \(build frontend\) atau build di CI.) Tj
T*
(- Kubernetes di VPS:) Tj
T*
(  - opsi 1: k3s \(single node\) di VPS \(paling simple\)) Tj
T*
(  - opsi 2: cluster K8s terpisah \(butuh konektivitas jaringan antara VPS ? cluster\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
