T*
() Tj
T*
(### 8.1 Install dependency backend) Tj
T*
(1\) Install Python + build tools:) Tj
T*
(   - `sudo apt install -y python3.11 python3.11-venv python3-pip build-essential`) Tj
T*
(2\) Clone repo:) Tj
T*
(   - `cd /opt && sudo git clone <REPO_URL> sapa`) Tj
T*
(   - `sudo chown -R deploy:deploy /opt/sapa`) Tj
T*
(3\) Setup venv:) Tj
T*
(   - `cd /opt/sapa/backend`) Tj
T*
(   - `python3.11 -m venv venv`) Tj
T*
(   - `./venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 8.2 Konfigurasi environment backend) Tj
T*
(Buat file env: `/opt/sapa/backend/.env` \(contoh\):) Tj
T*
(- `DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@<POSTGRES_HOST>:5432/sapa_db`) Tj
T*
(- `MONGODB_URI=mongodb://sapa-mongo.sapa.svc.cluster.local:27017`) Tj
T*
(- `MONGODB_DB=sapa`) Tj
T*
(- `MONGODB_COLLECTION_ATTENDANCE=attendance_logs`) Tj
T*
(- `MONGODB_COLLECTION_AUDIT=audit_logs`) Tj
T*
(- `MQTT_BROKER=sapa-mqtt.sapa.svc.cluster.local`) Tj
T*
(- `MQTT_PORT=1883`) Tj
T*
(- `SECRET_KEY=<isi-random-panjang>`) Tj
T*
(- `EDGE_INGEST_KEY=<isi-random-panjang>` \(opsional, jika ingin mengunci upload frame\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Jika Postgres tidak dipakai, bisa pakai SQLite:) Tj
T*
