T*
() Tj
T*
(### 8.3 systemd service) Tj
T*
(Buat file `/etc/systemd/system/sapa-backend.service`:) Tj
T*
(- WorkingDirectory: `/opt/sapa`) Tj
T*
(- ExecStart: `./backend/venv/bin/python -m uvicorn backend.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port) Tj
T*
(8080`) Tj
T*
(- Load env dari `/opt/sapa/backend/.env`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Contoh isi `/etc/systemd/system/sapa-backend.service`:) Tj
T*
(```ini) Tj
T*
([Unit]) Tj
T*
