(### 10.2 Nginx site config) Tj
T*
(Buat `/etc/nginx/sites-available/sapa`:) Tj
T*
(- server_name: `sapa.farhn.dev`) Tj
T*
(- root: `/var/www/sapa`) Tj
T*
(- SPA fallback: `try_files $uri /index.html`) Tj
T*
(- reverse proxy API:) Tj
T*
(  - location `/api/` ? `http://127.0.0.1:8080/`) Tj
T*
(  - pastikan rewrite menghapus prefix `/api`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Contoh konfigurasi `/etc/nginx/sites-available/sapa`:) Tj
T*
(```nginx) Tj
T*
(server {) Tj
T*
(  listen 80;) Tj
T*
(  server_name sapa.farhn.dev;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  root /var/www/sapa;) Tj
T*
(  index index.html;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  location / {) Tj
T*
(    try_files $uri /index.html;) Tj
T*
(  }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  location /api/ {) Tj
T*
(    proxy_http_version 1.1;) Tj
T*
(    proxy_set_header Host $host;) Tj
T*
(    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;) Tj
T*
(    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(    rewrite ^/api/\(.*\)$ /$1 break;) Tj
T*
(    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080;) Tj
T*
(  }) Tj
T*
(}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
