T*
(- `allow_anonymous false`) Tj
T*
(- pakai password file) Tj
T*
(- pakai ACL untuk membatasi publish/subscribe) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Contoh ACL konsep:) Tj
T*
(- user `backend`:) Tj
T*
(  - publish: `sapa/gate`) Tj
T*
(  - subscribe: `sapa/attendance`) Tj
T*
(- user `esp32`:) Tj
T*
(  - subscribe: `sapa/gate`) Tj
T*
(  - publish: `sapa/attendance`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
