T*
(   - `kubectl -n sapa create secret generic sapa-mosquitto-auth) Tj
T*
(--from-file=passwords=./passwords`) Tj
T*
(2\) Apply Mosquitto:) Tj
T*
(   - `kubectl apply -f k8s/mosquitto-production.yaml`) Tj
T*
(3\) Jika butuh akses dari ESP32 via LAN:) Tj
T*
(   - `kubectl apply -f k8s/mosquitto-nodeport.yaml`) Tj
T*
(   - Buka UFW hanya dari subnet LAN ke port 31883.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Contoh UFW allowlist LAN \(ganti subnet sesuai jaringan\):) Tj
T*
(- `sudo ufw allow from 192.168.0.0/24 to any port 31883 proto tcp`) Tj
