(## A\) Hardening VPS \(Host Ubuntu\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### A.1 Paket wajib) Tj
T*
(- `sudo apt update && sudo apt -y upgrade`) Tj
T*
(- `sudo apt install -y nginx ufw fail2ban ca-certificates curl git`) Tj
